// Quil - Hello World! :: RAiNBOW_Hello-World
//   colour     : not assigned by Linguist
//   layer      : full (byte-balanced rainbow bar)
//   upstream   : https://github.com/quxianp/RAiNBOW_Hello-World
//   reference  : see https://esolangs.org/ and https://rosettacode.org/

// Quil has no output instruction. A program declares classical
// registers, prepares qubits and measures into them; the numbers
// come back to the host, not out of a printer.
// Hello World!
DECLARE ro BIT[1]
H 0
MEASURE 0 ro[0]
